{"3732570": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Keep the Balance", "steam_appid": 3732570, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ONE WHEEL. ZERO MERCY.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Keep the Balance&quot; is a balancing act that looks simple but is nearly impossible to master. You're not just controlling a character; you're learning a new limb—one that's clumsy, difficult, but full of potential. Every inch of progress is a victory, and every fall is an unforgettable memory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn't just a game. It's a test of patience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732570/extras/3f8e5bf2451c24573253a2afde2eb6e8.poster.avif?t=1776005476\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732570/extras/3f8e5bf2451c24573253a2afde2eb6e8.webm?t=1776005476\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732570/extras/3f8e5bf2451c24573253a2afde2eb6e8.mp4?t=1776005476\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE CONTROLS ARE SIMPLE, THE STRUGGLE IS REAL</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no complex combos or skill trees here. It's just you, your unicycle, and the unforgiving laws of physics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732570/extras/0e0ad91b5b82fdddbe7329ef50697a87.poster.avif?t=1776005476\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732570/extras/0e0ad91b5b82fdddbe7329ef50697a87.webm?t=1776005476\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732570/extras/0e0ad91b5b82fdddbe7329ef50697a87.mp4?t=1776005476\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WORLDS TO MASTER</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a journey. Every world is filled with new and devilish obstacles designed to test your balancing skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732570/extras/1da5ea8873bfd7824af300a435144a1e.poster.avif?t=1776005476\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732570/extras/1da5ea8873bfd7824af300a435144a1e.webm?t=1776005476\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3732570/extras/1da5ea8873bfd7824af300a435144a1e.mp4?t=1776005476\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>IF YOU ENJOY A GOOD RAGE-QUIT, YOU'RE IN THE RIGHT PLACE.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Keep the Balance&quot; offers you a new challenge. Challenge yourself, stream your attempts, and let your friends laugh with you (or at you)!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ONE WHEEL. ZERO MERCY.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Keep the Balance&quot; is a balancing act that looks simple but is nearly impossible to master. You're not just controlling a character; you're learning a new limb—one that's clumsy, difficult, but full of potential. Every inch of progress is a victory, and every fall is an unforgettable memory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn't just a game. It's a test of patience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\